  "description": "Yoon Seo-Ha doesn't have time for anything else, what with trying to stay afloat at her job and making plans to take down her cheating husband. That all changes when her uncle passes away, and she's left with their family's burial ground. But upon agreeing to accept this inheritance, mysterious and sudden deaths begin happening around her. Disturbed and frightened, Seo-Ha tries to get rid of the land, only to realize there may be more to this deadly family bequest than meets the eye...\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
